<title>USA: CCC to seek 20,500 tonnes wheat for Mozambique.</title>
<headline>CCC to seek 20,500 tonnes wheat for Mozambique.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of USDA said it would tender February 18 for 20,500 tonnes of northern spring/dark northern spring wheat for donation to Mozambique.</p>
<p>The wheat is for March 5-31 shipment and must have a minimum protein content of 12.5 percent.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
